The conversion vertex is required to be inside the cylindrical volume defined by the TPC outer field cage (r \(<\) 200cm) and the readout planes (\(|\)z\(|\)\(<\) 200cm). Because there is an uncertainty in the material in the SVT and SSD, conversions in the regions of the

